email.order_shipped.body:
Hello,

Good news — your Cellexia order {order_name} is on its way to you.

Track your delivery: {tracking_url}

A small reminder for when it arrives: consistency is where results live. Keep up your daily ritual and your skin will show it.

Manage your subscription anytime: {portal_url}

email.unskip_confirmed.body:
Hello,

Good news — the order you skipped has been restored, and your next delivery will arrive as originally planned.

Manage your subscription anytime: {portal_url}

email.pause_confirmed.body:
Hello,

Your subscription is now paused — no deliveries and no charges while you take a break. We'll remind you before it resumes, and you can come back sooner whenever you like.

Resume anytime: {portal_url}

email.resume_confirmed.body:
Hello,

Lovely to have you back. Your subscription is active again and your next delivery is being scheduled — your skin will be glad you returned.

See your next order date: {portal_url}

email.swap_confirmed.body:
Hello,

All set — your subscription now includes your new choice, arriving with your next delivery. Same subscriber price, same schedule.

Review your subscription: {portal_url}

email.frequency_changed.body:
Hello,

Done — your deliveries now follow your new schedule. We'll always remind you before each order ships, so you stay in control.

See your next delivery date: {portal_url}

email.quantity_changed.body:
Hello,

Done — we've updated the quantities in your subscription. The change takes effect with your next delivery.

Review your order: {portal_url}

email.rewards_unlocked.body:
Hello,

You've been with us for {rewards_unlock_day} days — and from today, your subscriber rewards are unlocked. They're our way of saying that your loyalty means everything.

Explore your rewards: {portal_url}

